  lattice/genus_enum.jl
      The genus traversal in enumerate_aut_free (the closures _invariants and
      callback, the spinor-genus seeding loop and the neighbor loop) is adapted
      from _enumerate_definite_genus! in Hecke's
      src/QuadForm/Quad/ZGenusRep.jl (compared at Hecke v0.39.22, commit
      5e926df660cf62880efddbe8295576d58c8b8845), with the invariant function
      and the isometry test replaced and the mass ledger removed. The file
      also calls the Hecke functions _neighbours, _theta_series and
      __is_isometric_with_isometry_definite at run time.

  lattice/lp_kill_rank_agnostic.py
      The search window and the output contract of short_vectors follow
      Hecke's src/QuadForm/Enumeration.jl (see the header of that file).

